WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:04.219
Unit five. Talking to AI Assistants!

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:10.381
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.431 --> 00:00:13.348
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.398 --> 00:00:17.806
Today we learn about Talking to AI Assistants. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:23.624
Voice command. Say it with me. Voice command!

6
00:00:27.157 --> 00:00:32.090
Ask a question. Say it with me. Ask a question!

7
00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:42.212
AI assistant. Say it with me. AI assistant!

8
00:00:45.713 --> 00:00:50.263
Understand. Say it with me. Understand!

9
00:00:53.778 --> 00:00:58.108
Respond. Say it with me. Respond!

10
00:01:01.571 --> 00:01:05.495
Polite. Say it with me. Polite!

11
00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:13.442
Limitation. Say it with me. Limitation!

12
00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:21.109
Double-check. Say it with me. Double-check!

13
00:01:24.608 --> 00:01:39.642
I can give a voice command or ask a question to an AI assistant. It tries to understand and respond politely, but it has a limitation and can make mistakes. I always double-check important information with an adult.

14
00:01:39.692 --> 00:01:43.067
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:43.843 --> 00:01:50.625
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:50.675 --> 00:01:52.567
AI assistant!

17
00:01:53.268 --> 00:01:58.821
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.871 --> 00:02:00.143
Limitation!

19
00:02:01.172 --> 00:02:10.005
Did you know? AI assistants sometimes get things wrong, so it's smart to check important answers with a trusted adult or book!

20
00:02:10.055 --> 00:02:12.393
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:13.205 --> 00:02:23.343
Think and answer. Why is it important to double-check what an AI assistant tells you?

22
00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:24.570
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.567 --> 00:02:31.336
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:34.240
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

